    turnFlow: "Two phases. Phase One: take turns anticlockwise; draw the top card of the talon and place it on your stack, and optionally give away cards from your stack or drawn talon cards onto opponents' stacks when a card fits (next rank above; lowest rank fits on Ace). Phase Two: play in tricks; beat the previous card with a higher card of the same suit or a trump, or pick up the lowest card in the trick. Last player left holding cards loses.",
